# dist tarball via `git archive`, which honours export-ignore — so the /examples entries that
# #478 added here were exactly what kept them out, and they are deliberately gone.
#
# The example is still its own composer sub-project and is NOT separately published; only its
# SOURCE rides along inside the SDK package. Its transients (vendor/, .runtime/, .frontend/)
# stay out via examples/.gitignore, which git archive also honours.
